From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: own Cliffs firmware mmap and PAS resource lifetime

Adapt the Iris33 mmap ABI from OnePlus SM7675 1138e00f. Match the three
device regions and payload offsets to exact Uke OS3.0.304.0 msm_video.ko
2976535e5523521d953bdc762fc446e02bd5b564b28db34789d066b6070406df.
Keep MMIO above the DMA pool. Reject missing, partial and out-of-range
mappings before starting firmware. Retain mappings on incomplete teardown.

Track authenticated firmware and refuse to free queues after failed PAS
shutdown or runtime resume. Preserve cleanup errors and existing platforms
without the optional memory hooks. This candidate has no physical boot claim.

